# sarpbc

Monorepo: `apps/front` (Nuxt 4) + `apps/back` (NestJS). pnpm only.

Before non-trivial work, read **[AGENTS.md](../AGENTS.md)** at the repo root and load the relevant skill from `.agents/skills/`:

- UI / copy / a11y → `geist-design`
- Design-system constraints for agents / UI drift → `llm-safe-design-system`
- NestJS / API / DB → `nestjs-best-practices`
- Nuxt / SSR / routing → `nuxt`
- Roadmap / backlog / scope grilling → `sarpbc-pm`

Do not duplicate full skill docs in responses. Prefer minimal diffs; oxlint + oxfmt; i18n for all user strings in the frontend.
